<p>3. Jee bhar ke apne bhai ko zainab(s.a) na ro saki<br />
majlis zameen e karbobala par na ho saki<br />
armaan e sayyeda mein..(2)<br />
bichad e safe azaa.... karbala chalo.... </p>

<p>4. Khanjar tale Hussain(a.s) ki aahein gawaah hai<br />
halmin mugheesuna ki sadaein gawaah hai<br />
kab se hume bulata hai..(2)<br />
Zahra(s.a) ka laadla.... karbala chalo.... </p>

<p>5. Jis khaak ne chupaya tha bint e Ali ka sar<br />
