us karbala ki khaak ka..(2)<br />
karne ko shukriyaa.... karbala chalo.... </p>

<p>6. Baazu katake jis jagah Abbas(a.s) so gaye<br />
armaan bawafa ke jaha'n dafn hogaye<br />
